# Working on tally

What an agent needs to know for this repository.

- [design/README.md](design/README.md) says how the design tree is read and changed. [design/constitution.md](design/constitution.md) decides between designs.
- Everything in the repository is written in English.
- Tests run in CI (`.github/workflows/ci.yml`), not on the machine the agents run on. Before a check, run `rustfmt` on each Rust file you changed or added, naming each file: CI checks the format first.
- The example ledger in `examples/` is what the owner's real ledger looks like; keep it readable by hand.
- A change that removes a command or an option adds a line to `CHANGELOG.md` under the next version, saying what was removed and what to use instead.

